    {
      "id": "147143bf-7cac-48e0-8bc1-923b1c03d63a",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 1 — Channel Characterization and Corpus (RI, Months 1–6)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d343914c-df22-469a-9617-a83429000b65",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "The Research Institution characterizes the undersea acoustic channel for the target shallow-water environments — multipath structure, absorption, and sound-speed profiles — and assembles a propagation-labeled, multi-node corpus from range collections and Distribution-A sources, balanced across threat classes and documented in a data card. Effort: RI Co-I 0.20 FTE + one graduate researcher. Deliverable: propagation-labeled multi-node corpus + data card.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c8021013-6663-4106-8479-b84107daa486",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 2 — Propagation-Aware Classifier (SBC, Months 3–9)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f32ba012-e459-4513-a5f2-0171953a9ee3",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Aerivio extends its 4-bit classifier to consume the RI’s propagation features as auxiliary inputs and emit calibrated per-node posteriors, retraining with quantization-aware training and saliency-guided pruning so the added inputs still fit the 2-watt budget. Effort: PI 0.25 FTE + ML engineer 0.20 FTE. Deliverable: extended 4-bit model + accuracy report on a session-disjoint split.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f7411430-15f3-481e-b991-523d02d49826",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 3 — On-Node Runtime and Power (SBC, Months 7–12)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cb6cd316-d593-46cf-a80b-91f7d1995432",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Port the extended classifier to the 2-watt node, integrate the deterministic scheduler, and benchmark p99 latency and sustained rail power under continuous load. Effort: systems engineer 0.35 FTE. Deliverable: node runtime + power/latency benchmark log.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cd723fdc-f258-4dfe-994c-459565b8e23e",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 4 — Consensus Fusion Design and Simulation (Joint, Months 9–15)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f7024fd8-4a95-4826-b871-bff7ebd640f4",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Jointly design a bandwidth-frugal posterior-consensus rule for the low-rate acoustic link and quantify fusion gain in a multi-node simulator driven by the Task 1 corpus and channel models. SBC owns the on-node implementation; RI owns the channel-accurate simulation. Deliverable: fusion protocol specification + simulated fusion-gain report.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dad4c649-7e2f-40bc-ba26-7b66468ddb6f",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 5 — Integrated Validation and Phase II Plan (Joint, Months 14–18)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "32b669d4-b0dc-4ca4-8f9f-2daf176f714b",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Validate accuracy, per-node latency and power, and multi-node fusion gain against pre-registered gates (per-node balanced F1 ≥ 0.92; 4-node fused F1 ≥ 0.96; per-node p99 ≤ 150 ms; sustained ≤ 2.0 W). Document results, limitations, and the Phase II at-sea demonstration plan. Deliverable: Phase I feasibility report + Phase II plan.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f8774453-d0d1-4116-8655-0858125d6db8",
      "type": "page_break",
      "content": null,
