    },
    {
      "id": "56793190-1f01-4b9b-a794-dc853bdc1eb6",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Assemble a multi-node hardware-in-the-loop bench and exercise the fusion protocol across physical nodes under injected channel conditions. Effort: systems engineer 0.30 FTE + PI 0.10 FTE. Deliverable: HIL bench + test report.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0933282f-a74d-4faa-bf07-f6cae474f628",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Task 7 — Tank/At-Sea Pre-Demonstration (Joint, Months 21–24)"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#155e75"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dae4ae17-d95d-42f6-910e-5cd95660f6c6",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Conduct a controlled tank and short at-sea pre-demonstration at the RI range to confirm fusion gain under real propagation, de-risking the Phase II demonstration. Deliverable: range pre-demo results + Phase II readiness memo.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "82e1a0ca-28f3-4f47-a400-1e0743b67e17",
      "type": "page_break",
      "content": null,
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "357d467c-6cc8-4c4c-9d75-2e7077fc718e",
      "type": "heading",
      "content": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Risk Management"
      },
      "style": {
        "color": "#0e7490"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "551cf657-06ac-4c6d-afb5-4dbed5381c9e",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Feasibility is judged against pre-registered gates, all of which must pass. The principal technical risks and their mitigations are tracked from kickoff and reviewed at each monthly status memo; the mid-base review (Month 9) is the decision point for the Task 3 latency budget and the Task 4 fusion approach.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "824ec970-d959-422d-8584-edeabd1e87c8",
      "type": "table",
      "content": {
        "headers": [
          "Risk",
          "Likelihood",
          "Impact",
          "Mitigation"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Propagation features do not improve accuracy",
            "Medium",
            "High",
            "Ablate auxiliary inputs early (Task 2); fall back to per-node calibration only"
          ],
          [
            "Fusion gain below target on low-rate link",
            "Medium",
            "High",
            "Bandwidth-frugal posterior sharing; simulate link budget in Task 4 before commit"
          ],
          [
            "On-node latency exceeds 150 ms with fusion",
            "Low",
            "High",
            "Reserve cores + static schedule; profile fusion cost early in Task 3"
          ],
          [
            "RI corpus/range schedule slips",
            "Low",
            "Medium",
            "Task 1 front-loaded; Distribution-A sources bridge until range data lands"
          ],
          [
            "SBC/RI interface churn",
            "Low",
            "Medium",
            "Shared data card + interface control memo at Month 3"
          ]
        ],
        "header_style": {
          "bg": "#0f2942",
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d8fd67fa-3089-4479-897b-0030d1674273",
      "type": "caption",
      "content": {
        "prefix": "Table",
        "number": 3,
        "text": "Principal Phase I risks, likelihood, impact, and mitigation."
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2ad1cef4-c8ce-4272-bbf3-606409747094",
      "type": "text_block",
      "content": {
        "text": "Cross-cutting mitigations: the effort is structured so that the SBC edge-AI track and the RI ocean-acoustics track can proceed in parallel with a small number of well-defined interfaces (the propagation feature schema and the posterior format), limiting the blast radius of any single slip.",
        "inline_formats": []
      },
      "style": {},
      "provenance": {
        "source": "manual"
      },
      "history": [],
      "library_eligible": false
    },
